| `security/supply-chain` | Same; source, locks, built candidates, policies | `contents: read`; no environment or production secret; no SARIF publication permission | Advisory DB fetch only from an allowlisted pinned scanner source; failure is not a pass | Redacted secret/dependency/license/SBOM/notice reports and SARIF as untrusted verification artifacts; verification/90d | None |

